      Tervalidasi 6318 tes diferensial vs buffer native Luau.
    - Loader mereplikasi pemanggilan asli Luraph:
      loadstring(THORHUB_PAYLOAD)(buffer.fromstring(THORHUB_PROGRAM))

    KREDIT:
    - Script asli: Chilli Hub by tienkhanh1 (stealabrainrotqaqa/chillihub)
